        "reference": "FLAVOR_TEXT",
        "subject": "Flavor Text"
      },
      "translations": {
        "fr_FR": {
          "text": "« Kauri, sache que le courage est le juste milieu entre la peur et l'audace ! » — Nikau",
          "locale": "fr_FR"
        },
        "en_US": {
          "text": "\"Kauri, remember that courage is the happy medium between fear and recklessness!\" — Nikau",
          "locale": "en_US"
        },
        "es_ES": {
          "text": "«Kauri, no olvides que el valor es el punto medio entre el miedo y la audacia». —Nikau",
          "locale": "es_ES"
        },
        "de_DE": {
          "text": "„Denk dran, Kauri, Mut liegt genau zwischen Angst und Leichtsinn!“ — Nikau",
          "locale": "de_DE"
        },
        "it_IT": {
          "text": "\"Kauri, ricorda che il coraggio è la giusta via di mezzo tra la paura e l'incoscienza!\" — Nikau",
          "locale": "it_IT"
        }
      },
      "id": "01KC94HSK21TDNP8ZX2WPREXRD",
      "text": "\"Kauri, remember that courage is the happy medium between fear and recklessness!\" — Nikau"
    }
  ],
